preorder; this is the `simp` normal form used to pass between the ideal encoding
and the `≤𝓛` encoding. -/
@[simp]
theorem mem_principalLeftIdealSet {a b : S} : a ∈ principalLeftIdealSet b ↔ IsGreenLeftDvd a b :=
  Iff.rfl


