inclusion of the `𝓛`-bridge `isGreenL_iff_principalLeftIdealSet_eq`. -/
theorem IsGreenLeftDvd.principalLeftIdealSet_subset {a b : S} (h : IsGreenLeftDvd a b) :
    principalLeftIdealSet a ⊆ principalLeftIdealSet b := fun _ hx => IsGreenLeftDvd.trans hx h


