inclusion of the `𝓡`-bridge `isGreenR_iff_principalRightIdealSet_eq`. -/
theorem IsGreenRightDvd.principalRightIdealSet_subset {a b : S} (h : IsGreenRightDvd a b) :
    principalRightIdealSet a ⊆ principalRightIdealSet b := fun _ hx => IsGreenRightDvd.trans hx h


